{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029501001:1":{"text":"저쪽에서 오시는 거면… 진짜 신의 계시를 들으러 달의 유적에 가신 거예요?","source_cn":"你们从那个方向过来，难道说……你们真的去月神遗殿聆听神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB74FA233EA73279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029501002:1":{"text":"당연하죠! 제가 선생님께 달의 신전 샘터에 넣을 블루문 스톤을 빌려드렸어요.","source_cn":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD524066E248CBC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"당연하죠! 제가 선생님께 달의 신전 샘터에 넣을 블루문 스톤을 빌려드렸어요.","female":"당연하죠! 제가 선생님께 달의 신전 샘터에 넣을 블루문 스톤을 빌려드렸어요.","variant_male_record_index":"115425","variant_female_record_index":"115426","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029501003:1":{"text":"너무 경솔하시네요. 그 전설에 대한 고증이 끝난 것도 아니었는데...","source_cn":"你也太莽撞了，我还没有做完这个传说的考证……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46EAA7200264528D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029501004:1":{"text":"기회가 왔을 때 바로 확인해 봐야죠!","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029501004":{"text":"기회가 왔을 때 바로 확인해 봐야죠!","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029501005:1":{"text":"이상한 일이 일어나지 않았다면 다행이고요.","source_cn":"那我就放心了，没有发生奇怪的事情就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7BC59C2D2266CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029501006:1":{"text":"음... 이상한 일이라면...","source_cn":"呃……奇怪的事倒也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEA23F4DA96D5FBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029501007:1":{"text":"네? 왜요? 설마...","source_cn":"嗯？怎么了，难道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69FDB2CC910A0F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029501008:1":{"text":"사실 신의 계시를 받았다고 하기엔 애매해요...","source_cn":"某种程度上来说，并没有成功获得月神的启示——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6CEA1E06004099E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029501009:1":{"text":"휴, 역시…","source_cn":"唉，果然如此……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DD2EE60D95D086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029501010:0":{"text":"하지만 저희는 반신 샤키탈리스님을 뵙고 왔답니다.","source_cn":"但我们见到了半神萨基塔里斯大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5618E26F27B17C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029501011:1":{"text":"네? 반신 샤키탈리스님이요?! 그분을 만날 수 있다면 여러 학술적 난제가 해결될 거 같은데...","source_cn":"什么？！那可是半神大人！一定有很多学术问题可以向他求证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719A41D5237B8B6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029501012:1":{"text":"반신님의 마력은 어땠어요? 외모는요? 장창을 들고 계시던가요?","source_cn":"半神大人的魔力是怎样的！半神大人样貌呢？他有手握长矛吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6739857EE6B03478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029501013:1":{"text":"이미 몇백 년이나 살고 계신다는 설이 있어요. 저도 직접 뵙고 싶은데...","source_cn":"据说他已经度过了几百年岁月，我也好想亲眼见证他的身姿啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A4D185CE9297FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029501014:1":{"text":"만약 그 소문이 어느 정도 근거가 있는 사실이라면, 다른 소문도 실행될 가능성이 있어요.","source_cn":"不过，如果这个传说是有一定现实依据的话，另一个传说也有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C32BAB60E4FAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029501015:1":{"text":"관심 있으신가요?","source_cn":"你们有兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53B54B3076DEF750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1029501015":{"text":"관심 있으신가요?","source_cn":"你们有兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53B54B3076DEF750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029501016:1":{"text":"두 번째 소문은 달의 유적에 두 개의 샘터가 숨겨져 있다는 거예요. 그 두 개의 샘터를 전부 열면 달의 신의 보물을 얻을 수 있다고 해요.","source_cn":"第二个传说是，月神遗殿隐藏着两个泉眼。如果能打开两处泉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949EF584E9532AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029501017:0":{"text":"샘터의 위치는 파악했는데, 구체적으로 어떻게 여는지, 달의 신의 보물이 대체 무엇인지는 아직 몰라요.","source_cn":"泉眼的位置我已经确定了，但是具体如何开启以及月神的宝藏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3287C12F8A2369D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1029501018:0":{"text":"전 보물 자체보다 그 보물이 무엇인지에 더 관심이 있어요. 그럼 부탁드릴게요!","source_cn":"我对宝藏本身并不感兴趣，只想窥得何为神的宝藏。拜托你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7BED4445A5467F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"관심 있어","source_cn":"很有兴趣","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A5D24E75A344C58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"관심 있어","female":"관심 있어","variant_male_record_index":"62288","variant_female_record_index":"62289","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"이야기 해봐","source_cn":"说来听听","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F84B74F7D4059D0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이야기 해봐","female":"이야기 해봐","variant_male_record_index":"62290","variant_female_record_index":"62291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"이번엔 페이가 잘했어","source_cn":"菲这次做得很好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADC10285CF3C6629","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이번엔 페이가 잘했어","female":"이번엔 페이가 잘했어","variant_male_record_index":"62284","variant_female_record_index":"62285","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"페이는 사고를 치지 않았어","source_cn":"菲没有闯祸","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB148984565E8A5AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"페이는 사고를 치지 않았어","female":"페이는 사고를 치지 않았어","variant_male_record_index":"62286","variant_female_record_index":"62287","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者阿莉雅":{"text":"상록수 학자 아리아","source":"冬青学者阿莉雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":4}}